# Side quests (sidequests/side.js, places.js, adventurers.js; data design/data/sidequests.toml). Every `ttl sidequest expect`
# and `ttl adventurers expect` prints "ttl: ..." when it does not hold, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# One Life 2 bot runs each mechanic once: travel/discovery, deliver (with a parcel), fetch, cull (near a place and inside a
# faction region), escort (client waits at `from`, follows, arrives; and a client that dies fails the job), then the
# ambient adventurers of Tempest's green. Bots do not walk: `ttl sidequest goto` stands the bot at a place, `bring` puts
# its escort client beside it, `poll` runs the mechanics now instead of waiting for the 2-second poll.
# Needs the staging world's builds (Tempest, Dwargon, Blumund, Englassia placed); a place that is not placed reads "pending"
# and its section fails, which is the point. Expect in the log: "[ttl] side: TtlBotSideA started smith_letter (deliver)",
# "... completed smith_letter (done)", "[ttl] side: TtlBotSideA's client merchant (...) for merchant_escort at ...",
# "[ttl] adventurers: tempest_green spawned <kind>", and no "[ttl] side command failed".
# Also check in game (not asserted): the parcel's name and lore, the client following the bot's owner on foot (FOLLOW_PLAYER),
# ambush mobs attacking the client, speech bubbles over the adventurers, adventurers walking to the inn at night.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotSideA
@sleep 2
kubejs stages add TtlBotSideA ttl.life2
ttl sidequest reset TtlBotSideA
clear TtlBotSideA
# R11: the places live on the canon continent; far out in the sea ring nothing counts as "on the continent".
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA continent 0,0 yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA continent 9000,0 no
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA place tempest_green resolved
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA place dwargon_plaza resolved
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA place rim_camp resolved
# Travel and discovery: the road west, started like a quest reward would, done on arrival; arriving also discovers the place.
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA road_to_englassia
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA active road_to_englassia yes
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA englassia_guild
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done road_to_englassia yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA stage road_to_englassia yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA seen englassia_guild yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA refused road_to_englassia yes
# Deliver: the smith's letter from Dwargon to Tempest. The parcel is in the inventory at once and taken at the green.
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA dwargon_plaza
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA smith_letter
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA parcel smith_letter 1
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA tempest_green
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done smith_letter yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA parcel smith_letter 0
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA stage smith_letter yes
# A repeatable job waits for its FTB reward (the stage-remove reward) before it can be taken again.
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA refused smith_letter yes
# Fetch: coal handed in automatically at Dwargon's plaza.
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA forge_coal
give TtlBotSideA minecraft:coal 32
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA dwargon_plaza
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done forge_coal yes
# Cull near a place: five direwolf kills (faked on the objective) at the wayfarers' camp.
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA rim_camp
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA rim_patrol
scoreboard players add TtlBotSideA ttl.sq.tensura_direwolf 5
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done rim_patrol yes
# Cull in a region: goblin kills at the rim (Jura) do not count, the same kills in Blumund do.
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA goblin_raiders
scoreboard players add TtlBotSideA ttl.sq.tensura_goblin 3
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA progress goblin_raiders 0
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA blumund_guild
@sleep 3
scoreboard players add TtlBotSideA ttl.sq.tensura_goblin 6
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done goblin_raiders yes
# Escort: Marlo waits at the camp, appears when the bot is there, is brought along to the dwarf village and arrives.
ttl sidequest reset TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA merchant_escort
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA phase merchant_escort wait
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA rim_camp
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA phase merchant_escort go
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA client merchant_escort alive
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA dwarf_road
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest bring TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done merchant_escort yes
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA stage merchant_escort yes
# Escort failure: the client of a second run dies; the job is gone, not done.
ttl sidequest reset TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA rim_camp
@sleep 3
ttl sidequest start TtlBotSideA merchant_escort
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA client merchant_escort alive
execute as TtlBotSideA at @s run kill @e[tag=ttl.side.client,distance=..32]
@sleep 1
ttl sidequest poll TtlBotSideA
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA active merchant_escort no
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA done merchant_escort no
ttl sidequest expect TtlBotSideA count 0
# Ambient adventurers: Tempest's green fills one adventurer per check while a player stands there, never past its cap (3).
ttl adventurers clear tempest_green
ttl sidequest goto TtlBotSideA tempest_green
@sleep 3
ttl adventurers expect tempest_green count 0
ttl adventurers populate tempest_green
ttl adventurers expect tempest_green count 1
ttl adventurers populate tempest_green
ttl adventurers populate tempest_green
ttl adventurers populate tempest_green
ttl adventurers expect tempest_green count 3
ttl adventurers sweep
ttl adventurers expect tempest_green count 3
ttl adventurers clear tempest_green
ttl adventurers expect tempest_green count 0
ttl sidequest reset TtlBotSideA
ttlbot remove TtlBotSideA
